#: ../../site/quickstart.md:1
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:3
msgid ""
"This walkthrough goes from a small in-memory frame to a rendered report. It "
"uses synthetic values and does not download market data; nothing here is an "
"investment result."
msgstr "本演练从一个小型内存帧走到一份渲染好的报表。数值是合成的，不下载行情数据；其中任何内容都不构成投资结论。"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:7
msgid "1. Build a return series and read a few numbers"
msgstr "1. 构建收益序列并读取几个数字"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:9
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"#include <fincore/dataframe.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/metrics/drawdown.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/metrics/ratios.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"#include <cstdio>\n"
"#include <vector>\n"
"\n"
"int main() {\n"
"    const std::vector<fincore::timestamp> index{\n"
"        fincore::utc_timestamp(2025, 1, 2),\n"
"        fincore::utc_timestamp(2025, 1, 3),\n"
"        fincore::utc_timestamp(2025, 1, 6),\n"
"        fincore::utc_timestamp(2025, 1, 7)};\n"
"\n"
"    fincore::dataframe returns;\n"
"    returns.load_index(std::vector<fincore::timestamp>(index));\n"
"    returns.load_column<double>(\n"
"        \"returns\", {0.012, -0.02, 0.005, 0.03},\n"
"        hmdf::nan_policy::dont_pad_with_nans);\n"
"\n"
"    std::printf(\"sharpe  %.4f\\n\", fincore::sharpe_ratio(returns, "
"\"returns\"));\n"
"    std::printf(\"max dd  %.4f\\n\", fincore::max_drawdown(returns, "
"\"returns\"));\n"
"    return 0;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"#include <fincore/dataframe.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/metrics/drawdown.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/metrics/ratios.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"#include <cstdio>\n"
"#include <vector>\n"
"\n"
"int main() {\n"
"    const std::vector<fincore::timestamp> index{\n"
"        fincore::utc_timestamp(2025, 1, 2),\n"
"        fincore::utc_timestamp(2025, 1, 3),\n"
"        fincore::utc_timestamp(2025, 1, 6),\n"
"        fincore::utc_timestamp(2025, 1, 7)};\n"
"\n"
"    fincore::dataframe returns;\n"
"    returns.load_index(std::vector<fincore::timestamp>(index));\n"
"    returns.load_column<double>(\n"
"        \"returns\", {0.012, -0.02, 0.005, 0.03},\n"
"        hmdf::nan_policy::dont_pad_with_nans);\n"
"\n"
"    std::printf(\"sharpe  %.4f\\n\", fincore::sharpe_ratio(returns, "
"\"returns\"));\n"
"    std::printf(\"max dd  %.4f\\n\", fincore::max_drawdown(returns, "
"\"returns\"));\n"
"    return 0;\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:36
msgid "Three things are worth noticing:"
msgstr "有三点值得注意："

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:38
msgid ""
"The index is explicit; `utc_timestamp` validates the calendar date and "
"rejects an unrepresentable one."
msgstr "索引是显式给出的；`utc_timestamp` 会校验日历日期，并拒绝无法表示的日期。"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:40
msgid ""
"`dont_pad_with_nans` keeps the values exactly as given. A padding policy "
"would insert `NaN` for absent positions instead."
msgstr "`dont_pad_with_nans` 按原样保留数值。若改用补齐策略，缺失位置会被填入 `NaN`。"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:42
msgid ""
"Metrics take the column name. Passing a column that does not exist, or one "
"that is not a `double` column, raises `input_error` — a typo fails loudly."
msgstr "指标函数需要列名。传入不存在的列，或不是 `double` 的列，都会抛 `input_error` —— 拼写错误不会静默通过。"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:45
msgid "2. Prepare a factor panel"
msgstr "2. 准备因子面板"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:47
msgid ""
"`analyze_factor` consumes `prepared_factor_data`: rows, forward labels and a"
" cleaning-loss report. Each row's `forward_returns` vector must be aligned "
"by position with `forward_labels`."
msgstr ""
"`analyze_factor` 接受 `prepared_factor_data`：行、前瞻标签与清洗损失报告。每行的 "
"`forward_returns` 必须按位置与 `forward_labels` 对齐。"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:51
msgid ""
"#include <fincore/factor/analysis.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"fincore::prepared_factor_data data;\n"
"data.forward_labels = {\"1D\", \"5D\"};\n"
"const auto start = fincore::utc_timestamp(2022, 1, 3);\n"
"const auto day = 86'400'000'000'000LL;\n"
"const char* assets[] = {\"ALPHA\", \"BETA\", \"GAMMA\", \"DELTA\", "
"\"EPSILON\"};\n"
"\n"
"for (int date = 0; date < 40; ++date) {\n"
"    for (int asset = 0; asset < 5; ++asset) {\n"
"        fincore::factor_row row;\n"
"        row.date = start + date * day;\n"
"        row.asset = assets[asset];\n"
"        row.factor = 0.01 * static_cast<double>(asset) -\n"
"                     0.02 * static_cast<double>(date % 7);\n"
"        row.quantile = asset + 1;                 // caller-supplied bucket\n"
"        row.forward_returns = {0.001 * (date % 5),\n"
"                               0.002 * (asset % 3)};  // aligned with 1D, 5D"
"\n"
"        data.rows.push_back(row);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fincore::factor_analysis_config config;\n"
"config.periods = {\"1D\", \"5D\"};\n"
"config.turnover_periods = {1, 5};\n"
"config.include_portfolio_inputs = false;\n"
"\n"
"const auto model = fincore::analyze_factor(data, config);\n"
msgstr ""
"#include <fincore/factor/analysis.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"fincore::prepared_factor_data data;\n"
"data.forward_labels = {\"1D\", \"5D\"};\n"
"const auto start = fincore::utc_timestamp(2022, 1, 3);\n"
"const auto day = 86'400'000'000'000LL;\n"
"const char* assets[] = {\"ALPHA\", \"BETA\", \"GAMMA\", \"DELTA\", "
"\"EPSILON\"};\n"
"\n"
"for (int date = 0; date < 40; ++date) {\n"
"    for (int asset = 0; asset < 5; ++asset) {\n"
"        fincore::factor_row row;\n"
"        row.date = start + date * day;\n"
"        row.asset = assets[asset];\n"
"        row.factor = 0.01 * static_cast<double>(asset) -\n"
"                     0.02 * static_cast<double>(date % 7);\n"
"        row.quantile = asset + 1;                 // caller-supplied bucket\n"
"        row.forward_returns = {0.001 * (date % 5),\n"
"                               0.002 * (asset % 3)};  // aligned with 1D, 5D"
"\n"
"        data.rows.push_back(row);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fincore::factor_analysis_config config;\n"
"config.periods = {\"1D\", \"5D\"};\n"
"config.turnover_periods = {1, 5};\n"
"config.include_portfolio_inputs = false;\n"
"\n"
"const auto model = fincore::analyze_factor(data, config);\n"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:82
msgid ""
"`quantile` is supplied by the caller, not computed: the analysis studies the"
" buckets you declare. `periods` must name prepared labels, and "
"`forward_returns` is aligned with `forward_labels` by position, which is why"
" the two lists here describe the same columns in the same order."
msgstr ""
"`quantile` 由调用方给出而不是计算得到：分析研究的是你声明的分桶。`periods` 必须是已准备的标签，而 "
"`forward_returns` 按位置与 `forward_labels` 对齐，所以这里的两个列表描述的是同样顺序的同样列。"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:87
msgid "3. Render a report"
msgstr "3. 渲染报表"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:89
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"#include <fincore/factor/report.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/html.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/xlsx.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"#include <fstream>\n"
"#include <string>\n"
"\n"
"const auto document = fincore::build_factor_report(model, \"Factor "
"Report\");\n"
"\n"
"fincore::report_html_options options;\n"
"options.language = \"en\";                 // \"zh\" for the Chinese labels\n"
"const std::string html = fincore::render_html(document, options);\n"
"const std::string workbook = fincore::render_xlsx(document);\n"
"\n"
"std::ofstream{\"factor_report.html\", std::ios::binary} << html;\n"
"std::ofstream{\"factor_report.xlsx\", std::ios::binary} << workbook;\n"
msgstr ""
"#include <fincore/factor/report.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/html.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/xlsx.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"#include <fstream>\n"
"#include <string>\n"
"\n"
"const auto document = fincore::build_factor_report(model, \"Factor "
"Report\");\n"
"\n"
"fincore::report_html_options options;\n"
"options.language = \"en\";                 // \"zh\" for the Chinese labels\n"
"const std::string html = fincore::render_html(document, options);\n"
"const std::string workbook = fincore::render_xlsx(document);\n"
"\n"
"std::ofstream{\"factor_report.html\", std::ios::binary} << html;\n"
"std::ofstream{\"factor_report.xlsx\", std::ios::binary} << workbook;\n"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:108
msgid ""
"The same `report_document` drives every backend. `render_html` produces one "
"file per language from the same model, and `render_xlsx`, "
"`render_pdf_bytes`, `render_plotly`, `render_bokeh` and `render_matplotlib` "
"are further views of it. Rendering twice produces byte-identical output for "
"the deterministic backends, which is what makes reports safe to hash and "
"diff."
msgstr ""
"同一个 `report_document` 驱动所有后端。`render_html` 用同一模型为每种语言各产出一份文件，而 "
"`render_xlsx`、`render_pdf_bytes`、`render_plotly`、`render_bokeh` 与 "
"`render_matplotlib` 是它的其他视图。对确定性后端来说，渲染两次得到的字节完全一致，这正是报表可以被哈希与比较的原因。"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:114
msgid "4. Handle failures where they happen"
msgstr "4. 在出错处处理失败"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:116
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"#include <fincore/error.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"try {\n"
"    const double sharpe = fincore::sharpe_ratio(returns, \"missing\");\n"
"    (void)sharpe;\n"
"} catch (const fincore::input_error& error) {\n"
"    std::fprintf(stderr, \"rejected: %s (%s)\\n\", error.what(),\n"
"                 error.code().c_str());\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"#include <fincore/error.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"try {\n"
"    const double sharpe = fincore::sharpe_ratio(returns, \"missing\");\n"
"    (void)sharpe;\n"
"} catch (const fincore::input_error& error) {\n"
"    std::fprintf(stderr, \"rejected: %s (%s)\\n\", error.what(),\n"
"                 error.code().c_str());\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../site/quickstart.md:128
msgid ""
"Structural problems throw; a well-formed series that simply cannot produce "
"the statistic returns `NaN`. Check `std::isnan` for the second case and "
"catch `fincore::fincore_error` for the first."
msgstr ""
"结构性问题会抛出异常；本身合法但无法算出该统计量的序列返回 `NaN`。前者用 `fincore::fincore_error` 捕获，后者用 "
"`std::isnan` 判断。"

